\item[S2] Andrew Shallue and Jonathan Webster, \emph{Fast tabulation of challenge pseudoprimes}, arXiv:1806.08697 (2018); Open Book Series 2 (2019), 411--428. Introduction and Section2, pages1--3. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1806.08697}.
